I exhibited at the African Food and[ Products] Exhibition 2018. The Event was a wonderful one and an eye-opener for not just[ me] but for other exhibitors and attendees. From the conference sessions, I acquired knowledge on exportation of goods. The AFPE 2018 was the door opener to my exquisite Zobo Business. I thought to myself that since the Exhibition was for African Food and[ Products], Zobo is an African drink so I decided to make and sell for the Exhibition. Just like magic, amidst my other products, the[ z]obo made super sales. Now[ I] have a branded Zobo drink[.]
